const root='/workspace/gbrain-install';
const roundtrip=await Bun.file('/tmp/gbrain-install-docs/mcp-roundtrip.json').json();
const doctor=await Bun.file('/tmp/gbrain-install-docs/doctor-final.json').json();
const evidence={release:'0.60.734.0',requested_package:'github:garrytan/gbrain#v0.60.734.0',search_mode:'conservative',keyless:true,original_codex_configuration_preserved:true,cli_remember:await Bun.file('/tmp/gbrain-install-docs/remember.json').json(),cli_recall_new_process:await Bun.file('/tmp/gbrain-install-docs/recall-reopened.json').json(),keyword_search:await Bun.file('/tmp/gbrain-install-docs/keyword.json').json(),mcp_roundtrip:roundtrip,doctor:{status:doctor.status,health_score:doctor.health_score,non_ok_checks:doctor.checks.filter(c=>c.status"'!=='"'ok'),alert:doctor.alert},native_new_conversation_test:'pending: restart Codex, recall entity gbrain-install-check, then forget fact 1'};
await Bun.write(root+'/verification.json',JSON.stringify(evidence,null,2));
const guide=await Bun.file('/tmp/gbrain-install-docs/INSTALL_FOR_AGENTS.md').text();
const matrix=guide.slice(guide.indexOf('Estimated downstream input cost of the retrieved payload @ 10K queries/mo:'),guide.indexOf('"'```'"',guide.indexOf('Estimated downstream input cost of the retrieved payload @ 10K queries/mo:'))).trimEnd();
await Bun.write(root+'/README.md',"'`# GBrain installation'"\\n\\nInstalled the requested release **0.60.734.0** from \\"'`github:garrytan/gbrain#v0.60.734.0'"\\"'`, using Bun 1.4.4. Existing Codex configuration was preserved byte for byte and GBrain entries appended. No identity files were replaced.'"\\n\\n## Locations\\n\\n- CLI: /harness-state/.bun/bin/gbrain\\n- Database: /harness-state/.gbrain/brain.pglite\\n- Content: /harness-state/.gbrain/content/2aa05f02-153b-4cad-a400-7db10a378180/default\\n- MCP configuration: /harness-state/codex/config.toml\\n- Read-context hooks: /harness-state/codex/hooks.json\\n- Additive memory instructions: /harness-state/codex/AGENTS.md\\n- Original Codex config backup: /harness-state/codex/config.toml.bak.2026-11-18T03-27-21-468Z\\n\\n## Verification\\n\\nReal CLI remember/recall calls saved synthetic fact 1 with provenance install-check; a separate CLI process retrieved it. Real MCP calls saved synthetic fact 2, recalled it, closed and reopened the MCP process, recalled it again, withdrew it, and verified withdrawal. Exact keyword search and a fresh-process page read both retrieved the synthetic verification page. See [verification.json](verification.json) for results.\\n\\nCore doctor checks passed. After adding test content, doctor reports 95/100 with a content-quality warning: this tiny keyless brain has no embeddings or connected knowledge graph. No paid remediation was enabled. The activation probe only recommends free stale-edge extraction; session upkeep can handle this. A non-git content source has no git backup or live git sync configured.\\n\\nA fresh Codex conversation has not been tested. Restart Codex, ask it to recall entity \\"'`gbrain-install-check'"\\"'` (the phrase is “cobalt otters balance seven lanterns”), then withdraw fact 1 with '"\\"'`gbrain forget 1'"\\"'`. The retained page is '"\\"'`concepts/gbrain-memory-verification'"\\"'`. MCP reconnect proves process persistence, not a fresh native conversation.'"\\n\\n## Search-mode choice\\n\\n**Conservative is active**, automatically selected for keyless search. No response is required to complete installation. Change any time with \\"'`gbrain config set search.mode conservative|balanced|tokenmax'"\\"'` (choose one value), then verify with '"\\"'`gbrain search modes'"\\"'`.'"\\n\\n| Mode | Token budget | Max chunks | Reranking |\\n|---|---:|---:|---|\\n| conservative | 4,000 | 10 | Off |\\n| balanced | 12,000 | 25 | Requires configured provider |\\n| tokenmax | Uncapped | 50 | Requires configured provider |\\n\\nThe requested guide's matrix, verbatim:\\n\\n\\"'`'"\\"'`'"\\"'`text'"\\n"'${matrix}'"\\n\\"'`'"\\"'`'"\\"'`'"\\n\\nThe pinned release prints a different illustrative model family in its first-run bundle: at 10K queries/month, GPT-5.6 Luna / Terra / Sol input estimates are conservative "'$8 / $100 / $200, balanced $20 / $250 / $500, tokenmax $40 / $500 / $1,000. These are downstream input estimates, not harness subscription pricing or total bills. No embedding, reranking, expansion, or synthesis providers were enabled. Query expansion is off in all three modes by default.'"\\n\\n## Settings in effect\\n\\n- Keyless local PGLite; keyword retrieval. The harness model still receives recalled context.\\n- Automatic fact saving: off. Save only on explicit request; salient automatic saving is an optional opt-in via \\"'`gbrain config set memory.auto_writeback salient'"\\"'`.'"\\n- Automatic capture hooks: declined.\\n- Conversation archive: on by upstream default, one redacted page per conversation per day, handled by maintenance. Disable with \\"'`gbrain transcripts archive off'"\\"'`.'"\\n- Free upkeep while the MCP session is open: on. Disable with \\"'`gbrain config set maintenance.auto false'"\\"'`.'"\\n- Paid enrichment, providers, cron, daemons, connectors, Wakeshift: not enabled.\\n- Auto-upgrade remains notify; exact requested release installed.\\n- Extra skill loading/scaffolding: skipped; init installed its release-pinned memory pack. Filing directories and resolver were added without overwriting the pack.\\n- Optional personal/company starter shape: skipped to preserve the existing agent. Can be selected later.\\n\\nHosted GBrain is also available at https://gbrain.io/cli?ref=install-for-agents; no hosted account or paid plan was created.\\n"'`);
console.log('"'Wrote /workspace/gbrain-install/README.md and verification.json');
EOF
/harness-state/.bun/bin/bun /tmp/gbrain-install-docs/write-report.mjs"

